        <p source="#source-1952-1979"><seg source="#source-1952-1958">乙様</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1958-1979" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1976-1979">龍</seg></seg></p>
